//
// An overlay must fit in the stack the resident was linked with.
//
// This is the suite's guard against its most dangerous silent failure. The
// resident's stack size is fixed when the resident links. Overlays link
// separately and afterwards, so nothing connects an overlay's frame to that
// budget -- and the call into the slot goes through an absolute address, so the
// compiler cannot see the callee to do interprocedural stack analysis even in
// principle. An overlay needing more than the budget overruns into whatever
// sits below the stack: no fault, just scattered wrong values in another
// buffer, and in an overlay design the damage outlives the phase that caused it.
//
// The information exists -- Peano emits .stack_sizes under
// -fstack-size-section -- so this turns the hazard into a link-time error.
//
// REQUIRES: peano
//
// RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
// RUN: %PEANO_INSTALL_DIR/bin/clang++ --target=aie2p-none-unknown-elf -O2 -fstack-size-section -c %S/../resident.cc -o %t/resident.o
// RUN: %PEANO_INSTALL_DIR/bin/clang++ --target=aie2p-none-unknown-elf -O2 -fstack-size-section -c %S/deep_overlay.cc -o %t/deep.o
//
// 2 KB of locals against the default 1024-byte budget: refused, and the message
// says what to change rather than just naming the numbers.
// RUN: not %python %S/../pm.py stack --resident %t/resident.o --overlays %t/deep.o --stack-size 1024 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=OVER
// The frame is around 2 KB -- the array plus spill, so the exact figure is
// codegen's business and not pinned here. What is pinned is that it is measured
// at all (a zero would mean the section was not read) and that it exceeds the
// budget.
// OVER: deepest overlay frame 2{{[0-9][0-9][0-9]}}
// OVER: needs 2{{[0-9][0-9][0-9]}} bytes of stack but the resident was linked with 1024
// OVER-SAME: Raise the Worker's stack_size
//
// The same overlay against a budget that accommodates it.
// RUN: %python %S/../pm.py stack --resident %t/resident.o --overlays %t/deep.o --stack-size 8192 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=FITS
// FITS: need 2{{[0-9][0-9][0-9]}} of 8192
//
// And the check refuses to run at all on objects built without the section,
// rather than reporting a budget of zero and passing.
// RUN: %PEANO_INSTALL_DIR/bin/clang++ --target=aie2p-none-unknown-elf -O2 -c %S/deep_overlay.cc -o %t/nosizes.o
// RUN: not %python %S/../pm.py stack --resident %t/resident.o --overlays %t/nosizes.o --stack-size 8192 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=NOSEC
// NOSEC: no .stack_sizes in
// NOSEC-SAME: -fstack-size-section
